      "created_at": "2019-05-27T14:56:44.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>On the back of each Spirit Panel there is a section titled \"Summary Of Powers\".&nbsp;I understand the following:</p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>Offense means the amount of Damage/Destroy Powers a Spirit has</li>\n\t<li>Defense means the amount of Defend/Blight-Removal&nbsp;Powers a Spirit has</li>\n\t<li>Fear&nbsp;means the amount of Fear Generating&nbsp;Powers a Spirit has</li>\n</ul>\n<p>But what&nbsp;do \"Control\" &amp; \"Utility\" really mean?</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:52:49.405Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
