      "title_is_group": false,
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "<p>On the back of each Spirit Panel there is a section titled \"Summary Of Powers\".&nbsp;I understand the following:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n\t<li>Offense means the amount of Damage/Destroy Powers a Spirit has</li>\r\n\t<li>Defense means the amount of Defend/Blight-Removal&nbsp;Powers a Spirit has</li>\r\n\t<li>Fear&nbsp;means the amount of Fear Generating&nbsp;Powers a Spirit has</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>But what&nbsp;do \"Control\" &amp; \"Utility\" really mean?</p>",
